I come into my room.
I close the door.
There is a small bathroom in the room.
I go inside.
I wash my face.
The water is cold and nice.
Now I go to bed.
I am very tired today.
The fan in the room is on.
The sound of the fan is loud.
Outside the window is the city of Mumbai.
This city is not quiet.
I listen to the sounds of the city.
I am a little nervous.
But I am also very happy.
My new life begins now.
This is my first night in India.
I close my eyes.
